#' The viridisSYR colour map
#'
#' The fixed colour map behind [syr()]: 2001 colours at positions 0, 0.0005, ...,
#' 1. Navy (`#000E54`) is at position 0, the plasma start (`#0D0887`) at 0.05, the
#' plasma purple at 0.2875, Syracuse orange (`#F76700`) at 0.689 and the plasma
#' yellow at 1. It is generated by
#' [syr_build()] (script in `data-raw/syr.map.R`).
#'
#' @format A data frame with 2001 rows and columns:
#' \describe{
#'   \item{position}{position on the scale, 0 to 1}
#'   \item{hex}{colour, `#RRGGBB`}
#'   \item{R, G, B}{sRGB channels, 0 to 255}
#' }
#' @examples
#' head(syr.map)
#' syr.map[syr.map$position %in% c(0, 0.05, 0.2875, 0.689, 1), ]
"syr.map"
